 258:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			/** Shuts down the USB interface. This turns off the USB interface after deallocating all USB FI
 259:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			 *  memory, endpoints and pipes. When turned off, no USB functionality can be used until the int
 260:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			 *  is restarted with the \ref USB_Init() function.
 261:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 			 */
