 294:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *  was called. This value will be one of the \c USB_MODE_* masks defined elsewhere in this mod
 295:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *
 296:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/USBController_AVR8.h **** 				 *  \note This variable should be treated as read-only in the user application, and never manua
