 158:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  that the endpoint should have two banks, which requires more USB FIFO memory but results
 159:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  in faster transfers as one USB device (the AVR or the host) can access one bank while the ot
 160:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *  accesses the second bank.
